                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "beb52758-07ba-3654-8fb0-7e60190f64d1",
                        "entry_id": "f1796746-5091-3e82-9c12-ac5a899261f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who does not go to sea, who lacks the skills of a sailor or who is uncomfortable on ships or boats."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6474707-c981-46f5-b3fb-b6fb85b3af33",
                                "sense_id": "beb52758-07ba-3654-8fb0-7e60190f64d1",
                                "text": "So, deprived of one leg, and the strange ship of course being altogether unsupplied with the kindly invention, Ahab now found himself abjectly reduced to a clumsy landsman again; hopelessly eyeing the uncertain changeful height he could hardly hope to attain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "132b7010-0775-4541-9548-d749aa8e6adc",
                                "sense_id": "beb52758-07ba-3654-8fb0-7e60190f64d1",
                                "text": "If the landsman should wish the gang-plank moved a foot farther forward, he would probably say: “James, or William, one of you push that plank forward, please”; but put the mate in his place, and he would roar out: “Here, now, start that gang-plank for'ard! Lively, now! What're you about!...\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9f6be62-5c39-4253-8326-c3c2001d1819",
                                "sense_id": "beb52758-07ba-3654-8fb0-7e60190f64d1",
                                "text": "When I returned again to life, the same uproar, the same confused and violent movements, shook and deafened me; and presently, to my other pains and distresses, there was added the sickness of an unused landsman on the sea."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b32a15b9-21a9-3af5-af8e-11c7eda94196",
                        "entry_id": "f1796746-5091-3e82-9c12-ac5a899261f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who negotiates leases, contracts and other business deals between producers and landowners."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d596b5ca-8db1-35a9-acfd-2e5ffa5cb6ef",
                        "entry_id": "f1796746-5091-3e82-9c12-ac5a899261f1",
